<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of Dec 6, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Dec 6    WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 3,295    3,642 10,016</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     132	108    373</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    863	863  1,306</p>
<p>Total					 4,290    4,613 11,695</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 1,389    1,580   unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     318	315   unq</p>
<p>CCC stocks				  3,583    3,583   unq</p>
<p>Total					 5,290    5,478   unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
